 "closes": "The town census. It counts every resident by name, age and household each year, it is compiled by the Town Clerk, and it is the one record that would replace every estimate on this page with a count \u2014 including the two things the Census cannot say: which households have a child in the Lunenburg public schools, and what the people in them pay in property tax.",
